# What `railway up` uploads to the Railway builder.
# Mirror of .dockerignore — those exclusions keep files OUT of the image at
# COPY time, this file keeps them out of the upload tarball entirely.
# Without this, the CLI uploads ~150MB of skill assets, docs, and walkthrough
# images over a single TLS connection, which Windows AV/firewall middleware
# regularly corrupts (BadRecordMac on the upload POST).

skills/
docs/
walkthrough_html/
benchmarks/
tests/

.claude/
.claude-plugin/
.git/
.github/

*.md
LICENSE
.env
.env.example
docker-compose.yml
eval_harness.py
skill.md
